+The [Vizgen MERSCOPE platform](https://vizgen.com/products/), among the fluorescence-based targeted spatial transcriptomics platforms, allows the highest resolution (≤20 nm), while also providing a high capacity for multiplexing, with (customizable) panels containing up to 1000 genes, and an imageable area of 1 cm^2^. MERSCOPE was recently shown to be amongst the most sensitive in a recent head-to-head comparison [@Hartman2024] using mouse brain tissue.
